    "analysis": "HypiToken is a self-hostable multi-tenant LLM API gateway written in Go that pools Anthropic and OpenAI/Codex OAuth credentials and API keys behind Claude (/v1/messages) and Codex (/v1/chat/completions, /v1/responses) endpoints. It adds a SaaS layer with email-verified accounts, a USD wallet topped up via Alipay, per-token spend and rate caps, pricing groups, sticky sessions with credential rotation, a status page and a React operator console. It ships as a single binary with SQLite, aimed at operators reselling pooled model access, mainly in the Chinese market.",
